<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25942" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστρᾰτηγέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assume the position of general,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Phoc.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aem.</u>
				13
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>to out-general,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς Ῥωμαίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.39.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς βαρβάρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dion.Byz.
					53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τι</span>”
				<i>practise stratagems,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.37.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πόλεμον</span>
			<i>conduct</i> a war <i>to its close,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὰν ἀρχάν</span> Polusap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.9.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> at Rome,
				<i>come to the end of one's praetorship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				54.33
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
